00:00:35.630 --> 00:00:37.350
<b>Nee-san{Sis}, I'm done here.</b>

00:00:37.350 --> 00:00:39.810
<b>Shungo, you're slow as hell!</b>

00:00:41.640 --> 00:00:45.350
<b>How long do you take to beat a lowly opponent? It's freezing.</b>

00:00:45.810 --> 00:00:48.230
<b>Let's go to some place warm next.</b>

00:00:48.230 --> 00:00:50.690
