00:02:31.330 --> 00:02:36.010
Episode 1

00:02:31.330 --> 00:02:36.010
Kiss Her

00:02:31.330 --> 00:02:36.010
Episode 1

00:02:31.330 --> 00:02:36.010
Kiss Her

00:02:37.590 --> 00:02:39.010
<b>Hold it!</b>

00:02:42.970 --> 00:02:47.310
<b>Ayakawa-san, do you realise what you're doing right now?</b>

00:02:47.310 --> 00:02:49.600
<b>Of course. Sexual harassment. Right?</b>

00:02:49.600 --> 00:02:50.440
<b>Right?</b>

00:02:50.440 --> 00:02:53.560
<b>You shouldn't take things like that so lightly.</b>

00:02:53.560 --> 00:02:56.360
<b>Unless you're a couple who've pledged your futures.</b>

00:02:56.360 --> 00:02:57.440
<b>Really?</b>

00:02:57.440 --> 00:03:02.150
<b>We don't mind you seeing everything though, Ninomiya-kun.</b>

00:03:02.150 --> 00:03:05.450
<b>It may be okay for you all, but it's not okay for me.</b>

00:03:05.450 --> 00:03:09.960
<b>Besides, what's so fun about doing this in public?</b>

00:03:10.450 --> 00:03:12.290
<b>I've mentioned it many times before, haven't I?</b>

00:03:12.290 --> 00:03:17.210
<b>We love seeing your troubled face, Ninomiya-kun.</b>

00:03:17.210 --> 00:03:19.970
<b>What's more, today's one is gonna be amazing.</b>

00:03:21.380 --> 00:03:22.930
<b>Hinako is so daring!</b>

00:03:22.930 --> 00:03:24.510
<b>How dirty!</b>

00:03:34.060 --> 00:03:39.110
<b>Ninomiya-kun, you really can't lay a hand on girls, can you?</b>

00:03:39.110 --> 00:03:41.490
<b>I guess this is self-restraint too.</b>

00:03:42.860 --> 00:03:44.950
<b><i>This leaves me no choice.</i></b>

00:03:50.660 --> 00:03:52.370
<b>He jumped down again.</b>

00:03:52.370 --> 00:03:54.040
<b>And from this high too.</b>

00:03:54.040 --> 00:03:55.380
<b>He's good.</b>

00:04:28.570 --> 00:04:30.830
<b>Don't let your guard down, Ninomiya.</b>

00:04:30.830 --> 00:04:33.250
<b>It's really unsightly.</b>

00:04:34.620 --> 00:04:37.210
<b>Yoshida, Inoue! Was this your doing?</b>

00:04:37.210 --> 00:04:38.880
<b>Something like that.</b>

00:04:38.880 --> 00:04:43.380
<b>We love seeing your troubled face as well.</b>

00:04:43.380 --> 00:04:45.510
<b>Hey, class 1-A!</b>

00:04:45.510 --> 00:04:48.510
<b>Make sure you clean up properly.</b>

00:04:48.510 --> 00:04:51.220
<b>Roger, Vice President Komoto.</b>

00:04:55.520 --> 00:04:58.230
<b>Why is there a military chopper in school?</b>

00:04:58.230 --> 00:05:00.020
<b>That's so cool!</b>

00:05:40.560 --> 00:05:43.230
<b>Hey, wake me up?</b>

00:05:43.230 --> 00:05:46.320
<b>You know. With a kiss from a prince.</b>

00:05:53.200 --> 00:05:55.500
<b>No, I was just kidding.</b>

00:05:55.500 --> 00:05:58.120
<b>Because, I've already made a promise.</b>

00:05:58.120 --> 00:06:00.040
<b>A promise?</b>

00:06:00.710 --> 00:06:02.590
<b>But...</b>

00:06:02.590 --> 00:06:05.210
<b>if I really...</b>

00:06:05.210 --> 00:06:08.380
<b>don't wake up, then...</b>

00:06:16.390 --> 00:06:17.850
<b>A dream?</b>

00:06:17.850 --> 00:06:20.600
<b>That girl sure looked familiar.</b>

00:06:33.530 --> 00:06:36.500
<b>Why am I sharing a bed with a girl?</b>

00:06:38.120 --> 00:06:39.870
<b>She was from earlier.</b>

00:07:11.950 --> 00:07:14.830
<b><i>What was I trying to do?</i></b>

00:07:30.960 --> 00:07:33.180
<b>Umm, no...</b>

00:07:34.090 --> 00:07:35.680
<b>Don't!</b>

00:07:35.680 --> 00:07:37.430
<b>You mustn't touch me.</b>

00:07:37.850 --> 00:07:39.020
<b>Watch out!</b>

00:07:56.070 --> 00:07:58.950
<b>Is your body okay?</b>

00:08:00.080 --> 00:08:02.330
<b>Well, I don't feel anything wrong.</b>

00:08:04.960 --> 00:08:06.590
<b>Excuse me a little, okay?</b>

00:08:12.010 --> 00:08:14.470
<b>You're all right? Why?</b>

00:08:16.220 --> 00:08:20.060
<b><i>I'm touching a guy. How is this happening?</i></b>

00:08:24.810 --> 00:08:26.560
<b>I'm sorry!</b>

00:08:26.560 --> 00:08:29.690
<b>Well, I don't really mind though.</b>

00:08:29.690 --> 00:08:32.610
<b>What a predicament!</b>

00:08:32.610 --> 00:08:38.370
<b>Immediately after transferring, my precious Nee-san{sister} was assaulted while asleep by this barbarian.</b>

00:08:38.370 --> 00:08:39.370
<b>Brother?</b>

00:08:40.160 --> 00:08:42.000
<b>He's your brother?</b>

00:08:42.370 --> 00:08:45.080
<b>Good afternoon, Ninomiya Shungo-kun.</b>

00:08:45.080 --> 00:08:47.790
<b>My name is Tsukimura Mikihiko.</b>

00:08:47.790 --> 00:08:50.630
<b>Before the detailed introductions...</b>

00:08:50.630 --> 00:08:52.130
<b>First, take this.</b>

00:09:01.260 --> 00:09:02.560
<b>Hello?</b>

00:09:02.560 --> 00:09:04.140
<b><i>Shungo?</i></b>

00:09:06.060 --> 00:09:09.060
<b><i>Nee-san{Sis}? What's happening over there right now?</i></b>

00:09:09.070 --> 00:09:10.860
<b>I'm a little occupied right now.</b>

00:09:12.730 --> 00:09:17.780
<b>Anyway, the Tsukimuras, who are with you, are going to be staying with us starting today.</b>

00:09:17.780 --> 00:09:19.240
<b>Staying with us?</b>

00:09:19.240 --> 00:09:23.120
<b>Make sure you protect Mayu-chan, got it?</b>

00:09:24.580 --> 00:09:26.080
<b><i>Protect?</i></b>

00:09:27.160 --> 00:09:30.540
<b>I'm coming home tonight. Let's have meat for dinner.</b>

00:09:30.540 --> 00:09:32.500
<b>Cook us some good Tonkatsu (Fried Pork).</b>

00:09:33.420 --> 00:09:35.590
<b>Hello? Nee-san{Sis}?</b>

00:09:35.590 --> 00:09:37.300
<b>Nee-san{Sis}?</b>

00:09:38.050 --> 00:09:40.180
<b>So you understand the situation?</b>

00:09:40.180 --> 00:09:42.310
<b>Yeah, kinda.</b>

00:09:43.760 --> 00:09:46.520
<b><i>But, living together?</i></b>

00:09:52.310 --> 00:09:54.740
<b>My Nee-san{sister} is so shy, isn't she?</b>

00:09:54.740 --> 00:09:58.030
<b>Shungo-kun will be taking care of us from now on.</b>

00:09:58.030 --> 00:10:03.540
<b>Even if he's a person who does despicable things to girls while they're asleep on the first meeting...</b>

00:10:03.540 --> 00:10:06.580
<b>you've gotta greet him properly.</b>

00:10:08.830 --> 00:10:10.250
<b>Well...</b>

00:10:12.460 --> 00:10:14.710
<b>I'm Tsukimura Mayu.</b>

00:10:14.710 --> 00:10:17.630
<b>Nice to meet you. I'm Ninomiya Shungo.</b>

00:10:20.470 --> 00:10:22.470
<b>Are you still alive, Ninomiya?</b>

00:10:22.470 --> 00:10:24.390
<b>What happened to that girl earlier?</b>

00:10:36.570 --> 00:10:38.490
<b>Hey, you guys.</b>

00:10:40.610 --> 00:10:42.280
<b>How cute.</b>

00:10:57.420 --> 00:10:59.220
<b>What's going on?</b>

00:11:00.840 --> 00:11:01.510
<b>Hello?</b>

00:11:01.510 --> 00:11:03.550
<b><i>I forgot to mention this earlier but...</i></b>

00:11:03.550 --> 00:11:06.470
<b><i>she has androphobia. (Fear of men)</i></b>

00:11:07.020 --> 00:11:12.770
<b><i>But, because of her condition, her power of attracting men is incredibly powerful when she's distressed.</i></b>

00:11:12.770 --> 00:11:18.400
<b>So, from now on, it's your duty to protect Mayu-chan no matter what happens.</b>

00:11:18.400 --> 00:11:20.280
<b>You got that, right?</b>

00:11:20.280 --> 00:11:22.240
<b><i>If you're unable to protect Mayu-chan...</i></b>

00:11:22.240 --> 00:11:26.240
<b><i>then I'll make you participate in alien politics in an underground temple in the South Pole.</i></b>

00:11:26.240 --> 00:11:29.040
<b><i>Naked!</i>
-There are so many men.</b>

00:11:29.040 --> 00:11:31.790
<b>Ryoko-kun would seriously do it.</b>

00:11:34.080 --> 00:11:37.040
<b>Well then, I have business to attend to, so I'll be going.</b>

00:11:38.170 --> 00:11:42.550
<b>If you ever make Mayu cry, you'll regret ever being born.</b>

00:11:56.730 --> 00:11:58.270
<b>No.</b>

00:12:11.330 --> 00:12:13.410
<b>It's time to go, Tsukimura-san.</b>

00:12:37.980 --> 00:12:40.730
<b>What's that? Is Ninomiya-kun carrying a girl?</b>

00:12:40.730 --> 00:12:44.110
<b>It seems like he's protecting her with his life.</b>

00:12:47.320 --> 00:12:49.620
<b><i>That</i> Ninomiya-kun, huh?</b>

00:13:10.600 --> 00:13:12.140
<b>Here's no good either, huh?</b>

00:13:13.470 --> 00:13:15.270
<b>Has it always been like this?</b>

00:13:15.270 --> 00:13:21.440
<b>Up until now, I've only studied in a girl's convent. So, all this...</b>

00:13:26.150 --> 00:13:29.990
<b>Let's go back. We'd be circling around, but it's just a little bit further.</b>

00:13:29.990 --> 00:13:30.660
<b>Okay.</b>

00:13:35.710 --> 00:13:37.880
<b>Forgive me, Tsukimura-san.</b>

00:13:47.880 --> 00:13:51.890
<b>We're safe now. The only thing ahead is my house.</b>

00:13:53.100 --> 00:13:55.430
<b>That's a really nice house.</b>

00:13:55.430 --> 00:13:58.690
<b>My Nee-san{sister} got it from someone.</b>

00:13:58.690 --> 00:14:00.480
<b>Ryoko-san did?</b>

00:14:00.480 --> 00:14:04.740
<b>It's too big. It's hectic trying to clean the place.</b>

00:14:05.980 --> 00:14:06.900
<b>Please, come in.</b>

00:14:07.740 --> 00:14:09.610
<b>Pardon me.</b>

00:14:13.200 --> 00:14:15.490
<b>Living together, huh?</b>

00:14:20.120 --> 00:14:21.630
<b>Let's unpack.</b>

00:14:21.630 --> 00:14:23.710
<b>At least we've got plenty of rooms.</b>

00:14:29.300 --> 00:14:32.100
<b>What a terrible day.</b>

00:14:43.360 --> 00:14:45.650
<b>Are you done with the room?</b>

00:14:45.650 --> 00:14:50.570
<b>Yes. I'm sorry about you carrying practically all my belongings to the room.</b>

00:14:50.570 --> 00:14:53.780
<b>Well, you can go rest in the living room.</b>

00:14:57.200 --> 00:14:59.960
<b>Um... Do you always do the cooking?</b>

00:15:00.410 --> 00:15:03.130
<b>Basically, it's my job to do the housework.</b>

00:15:03.130 --> 00:15:05.290
<b>Nee-san{Sis} will complain if I don't.</b>

00:15:05.290 --> 00:15:07.340
<b>What about your parents?</b>

00:15:07.340 --> 00:15:11.760
<b>They're doing something overseas.
I'm sure they're alive somewhere.</b>

00:15:11.760 --> 00:15:13.680
<b>I-I see.</b>

00:15:19.350 --> 00:15:23.440
<b>If it's okay, will you let me help?</b>

00:15:23.440 --> 00:15:28.280
<b>I've caused you nothing but trouble. So, I'd like to give something back at the very least.</b>

00:15:28.280 --> 00:15:29.730
<b>Please.</b>

00:15:32.780 --> 00:15:35.820
<b>Then, can you help wash the potatoes?</b>

00:15:36.660 --> 00:15:38.000
<b>Sure.</b>

00:15:38.000 --> 00:15:41.200
<b>Tsukimura-san, can you grab these please?</b>

00:15:41.200 --> 00:15:42.250
<b>Sure.</b>

00:15:46.250 --> 00:15:49.210
<b>Sorry, Tsukimura-san. I didn't look on purpose.</b>

00:15:49.210 --> 00:15:51.460
<b>Is there a problem?</b>

00:15:51.460 --> 00:15:54.380
<b>No, just take them quickly, please.</b>

00:15:55.090 --> 00:15:57.760
<b>Sure, just leave it to me.</b>

00:16:18.870 --> 00:16:21.210
<b>Sorry, the water suddenly...</b>

00:16:22.290 --> 00:16:25.250
<b>Tsukimura-san, stand back for a moment.</b>

00:16:25.250 --> 00:16:27.290
<b>I'll deal with it somehow.</b>

00:16:33.380 --> 00:16:34.840
<b>I'm sorry...</b>

00:16:35.550 --> 00:16:37.350
<b>It wasn't your fault. Well, let's...</b>

00:16:48.060 --> 00:16:50.020
<b>Tsukimura-san, are you okay?</b>

00:17:01.280 --> 00:17:02.540
<b>I have to carry her quickly.</b>

00:17:17.930 --> 00:17:20.140
<b>What am I doing?!</b>

00:17:21.550 --> 00:17:22.390
<b>But...</b>

00:17:33.070 --> 00:17:35.150
<b>By the way, I forgot to mention this...</b>

00:17:35.820 --> 00:17:37.950
<b>Ah, go on please.</b>

00:17:39.740 --> 00:17:41.410
<b>Nee-san{Sis}?</b>

00:17:41.870 --> 00:17:42.660
<b>My, my...</b>

00:17:43.120 --> 00:17:45.830
<b>I don't mind you getting involved with my Nee-san{sister} but...</b>

00:17:46.160 --> 00:17:48.210
<b>you might die.</b>

00:17:53.500 --> 00:17:55.710
<b>Succubus, is it?</b>

00:17:56.090 --> 00:18:01.180
<b>Yes. Demons who drains life force from the opposite sex; the succubus.</b>

00:18:01.180 --> 00:18:03.390
<b>That's what my Nee-san{sister} and I are.</b>

00:18:04.600 --> 00:18:10.440
<b>Of course, other than that, physically, we're very much normal humans.</b>

00:18:10.440 --> 00:18:15.030
<b>But, we have the ability to attract the opposite sex.</b>

00:18:15.030 --> 00:18:16.320
<b>The opposite sex?</b>

00:18:16.700 --> 00:18:19.320
<b>Furthermore, Mayu's case is extreme.</b>

00:18:19.320 --> 00:18:23.410
<b>Unable to control her powers, she unconsciously attracts men.</b>

00:18:23.410 --> 00:18:28.290
<b>Whoever touches her will faint in a blink of an eye. Just as you had seen.</b>

00:18:28.290 --> 00:18:30.120
<b>So, that was...?</b>

00:18:36.420 --> 00:18:39.130
<b>But, I touched her many times.</b>

00:18:39.130 --> 00:18:42.680
<b>Well, it seems that you have some sort of resistance.</b>

00:18:42.680 --> 00:18:46.260
<b>But, it may have turned out really bad if you had kissed her earlier.</b>

00:18:46.260 --> 00:18:48.100
<b>What do you mean?</b>

00:18:48.100 --> 00:18:49.650
<b>Well, to put it simply, Shungo-kun...</b>

00:18:49.650 --> 00:18:54.190
<b>There's a possibility she may drain all your life force away.</b>

00:18:54.190 --> 00:18:56.070
<b>She could kill you.</b>

00:18:56.650 --> 00:19:01.530
<b>Well, as long as you don't do too much, I believe you should be fine.</b>

00:19:01.530 --> 00:19:04.490
<b>For her to make an unsociable person like you do what you did...</b>

00:19:04.870 --> 00:19:09.290
<b>Mayu-chan's succubus power must be incredibly powerful.</b>

00:19:13.670 --> 00:19:17.010
<b>Fortunately, she's already getting used to being with you.</b>

00:19:17.550 --> 00:19:24.140
<b>For the time being, we'll need your cooperation until she's cured of her androphobia.</b>

00:19:24.140 --> 00:19:26.220
<b>At home and at school.</b>

00:19:33.940 --> 00:19:35.360
<b>This is?</b>

00:19:38.570 --> 00:19:39.210
<b>Ah!</b>

00:19:39.210 --> 00:19:42.700
<b>I'm sorry, I'm sorry, I'm sorry, I'm sorry.</b>

00:19:42.700 --> 00:19:46.370
