00:19:47.830 --> 00:19:49.540
<b>Oh, really?</b>

00:19:51.540 --> 00:19:54.080
<b>This might not be a good place but...</b>

00:19:54.710 --> 00:19:57.090
<b>can we talk for a bit?</b>

00:20:00.590 --> 00:20:03.090
<b>I heard about your physical condition.</b>

00:20:04.510 --> 00:20:05.840
<b>Really?</b>

00:20:08.050 --> 00:20:11.100
<b>Aren't you scared of me?</b>

00:20:11.100 --> 00:20:15.440
<b>Because, I have the power to drain the life force of men.</b>

00:20:15.440 --> 00:20:18.570
<b>Furthermore, I'm unable to control it.</b>

00:20:18.570 --> 00:20:20.980
<b>Just like what happened earlier today.</b>

00:20:22.240 --> 00:20:24.740
<b>I guess I'm a little scared.</b>

00:20:28.990 --> 00:20:32.830
<b>Well, I have just one dream.</b>

00:20:32.830 --> 00:20:34.410
<b>Dream?</b>

00:20:34.410 --> 00:20:40.590
<b>I dream of living happily with the one man I love till the day I die.</b>

00:20:43.050 --> 00:20:46.260
<b>I'm so silly, aren't I? Since I'm a succubus.</b>

00:20:46.260 --> 00:20:51.260
<b>And on top of that, I have androphobia. 
And I talk about dreams like this.</b>

00:20:52.770 --> 00:20:54.270
<b>It'll come true.</b>

00:20:54.640 --> 00:20:58.400
<b>If you don't give up, I'm sure your dreams will come true.</b>

00:20:58.400 --> 00:21:01.770
<b>I'll do what I can to help.</b>

00:21:05.450 --> 00:21:07.780
<b>Thank you, Ninomiya-kun.</b>

00:21:13.200 --> 00:21:15.790
<b>I think I should be getting out now.</b>

00:21:24.420 --> 00:21:25.470
<b>Tsukimura-san?</b>

00:21:38.270 --> 00:21:41.230
<b>The situation is getting worse.</b>

00:21:41.780 --> 00:21:46.360
<b>If this goes on any longer, I'm gonna lose my self-control.</b>

00:21:51.280 --> 00:21:53.370
<b>You're not gonna kiss her, right?</b>

00:21:53.370 --> 00:21:55.830
<b>Holding back isn't good for the body.</b>

00:21:55.830 --> 00:21:57.920
<b>You can do anything to her now.</b>

00:21:57.920 --> 00:22:00.840
<b>I'm ready to shoot any time. Go on.</b>

00:22:01.250 --> 00:22:05.050
<b>But, I managed to get some interesting footage already.</b>

00:22:06.050 --> 00:22:10.050
<b>If you don't give up, I'm sure your dreams will come true.</b>

00:22:10.050 --> 00:22:12.970
<b>I'll do what I can to help.</b>

00:22:12.970 --> 00:22:14.180
<b>That's...!</b>

00:22:14.180 --> 00:22:17.190
<b>A man stands by his words, right, Shungo?</b>

00:22:17.190 --> 00:22:18.520
<b>Your resolve is inspiring.</b>

00:22:18.850 --> 00:22:23.860
<b>You're keeping your word by helping my Nee-san{sister} with her androphobia.</b>

00:22:23.860 --> 00:22:26.860
<b>It's time for the special training. Got it?</b>

00:22:32.830 --> 00:22:34.910
