<b>I'll try my best.</b>

00:22:50.390 --> 00:22:54.470
<b>Hold it, Tsukimura-san. Do you understand the situation?</b>

00:22:54.470 --> 00:22:55.430
<b>Of course.</b>

00:22:55.810 --> 00:23:01.230
